// The second walkthrough. UI is the other mechanism with no precedent in this
// course: a TMP text object wired in the Inspector, and a script that reads its
// numbers from the manager. Also level 1, and for the same reason — nothing here
// has been built before. Its whole first step used to be Inspector work inside a
