//
// It takes a position on the design question the old page asked and left open
// (read every frame, or only when the value changes?) and answers it in the
// `why` on the Update() line: read every frame, because correctness here is
// free and the "clever" version costs three fields that can go stale. The two
// real costs are named rather than hidden — a Canvas is scene-local, so the
// HUD shows in the scene that owns it, and a scene with no StatManager in it
// leaves the label blank.
